UID:icme-2027-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270713
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:ICME 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo\nStatus: c
 onfirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://2027.ieeeicme.org
 /\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#icme-2027\nNotes: 
 Official 2027 pages confirm Xiamen International Conference & Exhibition 
 Center\, July 13-17\, 2027. Regular and special-session papers share one 
 system\, review and Dec 30\, 2026 deadline\; the PDF says AOE without an 
 hour\, so 23:59 AoE is stored. The FAQ says submission opens in early Nov
 ember 2026 (portal not seen open). ICME 2026 moved its paper deadline fro
 m Dec 12 to Dec 31\, 2025. Some 2026 workshops set their own paper dates.
  Demo proposals (Apr 16\; 2-page proceedings papers in 2026) stay in note
 s per ADR-043. Accepted regular\, workshop\, demo and grand-challenge pap
 ers enter the IEEE proceedings. No official size figures found. Size is a
 n editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Multimedia Learning & Retrieval,Computer Vision & Pattern Recogn
 ition,Signal Processing
URL:https://2027.ieeeicme.org/
LOCATION:Xiamen\, China
